{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一段的大号白字与红色强调词「不再藏着喜欢」「我不再为它道歉」首先吸引视线；随后注意到中部金色强调词「连害臊都顾不上了」，最后才可能扫到下方灰白色粗体段落。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人决定不再隐藏自己对对方的喜欢。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"高兴、释然、坦然，不再羞怯。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他意识到自己需要对方，也愿意继续陪伴对方；对方未来是否还愿意让他陪伴并不确定，因此这份欢喜同时带着心痛。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线：上方红色强调、中部金色强调和下方灰白粗体都很突出。\",\n    \"单块太长、一块里有好几层意思，尤其上方第一段和下方最后一段。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里、要拼起来才懂：不再隐藏喜欢、因此感到高兴，以及未来关系的不确定和由此产生的心痛。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "968648a9-7ec8-4dbf-92ab-1d97511a5c46", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012258512869Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.985, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:23:36.507358+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bf76ba1403bb2b77802781b48c97ebbc66017b99e8e0916dcce34886b2ef7ba5", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42223